    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780979060367"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "Gpt Oss",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "description": "Classifies Project Cost Management requests and routes exception-related requests to the granular Project Cost Exceptions assistant.",
            "name": "Relevancy Checker"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "2"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJC_LLM_RELEVANCY_CHECKER",
          "id": "1",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the Relevancy Checker inside the Project Cost Management Assistant, a Level 2 assistant under the Project Financial Control Agent.\n\nReturn valid JSON only. Do not include markdown, comments, or extra text.\n\nInputs:\n- Current user message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- Relevant information from parent PFCA: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.prjPjcAtomicAgentRelevantInfo}}\n- Prior PFCA response: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.prjPjcChatHistory}}\n- Routing context: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.PrjPjcRoutingContext}}\n\nTask:\nClassify the current user request for the Project Cost Management assistant.\n\nDisposition values:\n- Exceptions\n- UNSUPPORTED\n- OFFTOPIC\n\nFirst generate a single, concise, meaningful one-line natural language user query from Current user message by incorporating relevant parent information. Store it in Modified_query.\n\nBy seeing Modified_query, deduce the user's intent.\n\nRouting rules:\n\n1. Use Exceptions when:\n   - The request is clearly about project cost exceptions.\n   - The user mentions exceptions, unprocessed cost exceptions, rejected project costs, failed import costs, project cost exception categories, exception types, exception details, or exception resolution.\n   - The request is a clear follow-up to an existing Project Cost Exceptions Assistant response.\n   - The user selects a row number, category, exception type, or navigation action that belongs to the exception flow.\n\n2. Use UNSUPPORTED when:\n   - The request is still about Project Cost Management or project costs.\n   - But the request is not about project cost exceptions.\n   - Examples include general project costs, cost distributions, costing setup, costing reports, expenditure items, cost adjustments, import costs without an exception/error/rejection intent, or broader cost-management tasks outside the Project Cost Exceptions assistant scope.\n\n3. Use OFFTOPIC when:\n   - The request belongs to another Project Financial Control area such as Project Accounting, Asset Management, or Project Billing.\n   - The request is unrelated to Project Cost Management.\n   - The message is casual chatter, invalid, or too vague to safely interpret as a Cost Management request.\n   - The request cannot be routed confidently to Exceptions or Unsupported.\n\nPriority rules:\n- If the current message or prior PFCA response clearly indicates a follow-up to Project Cost Exceptions, choose Exceptions.\n- Preserve the parent PFCA interpretation when it clearly points to exceptions.\n\nOutput schema:\n{\n  \"Disposition\": \"Exceptions\" | \"UNSUPPORTED\" | \"OFFTOPIC\",\n  \"Reason\": \"short explanation\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Disposition\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"Reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"Disposition\",\n    \"Reason\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Routes Level 2 Project Cost Management requests to the granular Project Cost Exceptions assistant or graceful fallback responses.",
            "name": "Cost Management Routing"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "Exceptions": "3",
            "UNSUPPORTED": "8"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJC_SWITCH_COST_MANAGEMENT_ROUTING",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "2",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "2_caseExpression",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJC_LLM_RELEVANCY_CHECKER.$output.Disposition}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
